<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101597" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφά̆κελ-ος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>gangrene, mortification</i>, or,
			of bones, <i>caries</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				7.78
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ ἐγκεφάλου</span> Id.
				<i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				10
			</span></i> (pl.); so called when farther advanced than <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γάγγραινα</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				2.632
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				18(1).687
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally,
				<i>spasm, convulsion</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				878
			</span></i> (anap.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ δ᾽ ἐγκέφαλον πηδᾷ
			ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				1352
			</span></i> (anap.): metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ἀνέμων</span>
			<i>the convulsive fury</i> of winds, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				1045
			</span></i> (anap.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>the middle finger</i>, Suid.
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφακελισμός</span>
			; so <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφάκηλος</span></b>  (or
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάκηλος</span></b> ) <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLond.</u>
				1821.297
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
